{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/27/8799053/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"用事があって、学校行って\nお仕事まで時間が中途半端だったので\n本屋に2時間くらいいた..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"脚が痛い！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":".........\n昨日はドラマ撮影後\nさゆりん、まなつ、ねねと\n中華街に行ってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/27/8799053/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに来た。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかいっぱい食べたよー\n何食べたっけ！\n全部美味しかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしていた\nゴマ団子がなかなか来なくて、\n店員さんに必死にゴマ団子\nアピールしたら困らせてしまった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/27/8799053/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴマ団子アピールてなんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来たときの感動ったらもう。\nゴマ団子美味しいよー\nその次にすきなのは\n黒ごまプリンなのよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが\nすきな中華料理は何ですかー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/27/8799053/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/27/8799053/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひよこみたいなひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/27/8799053/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/27/8799053/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/03/27/8799053/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふぇい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}